## Phase 1 — Email template and API scope

**Goal:** Seed `password_reset_otp`; verify History/Templates role enforcement.

**Exit criteria:** Super admin edits OTP template; internal send with `otp` payload appears in history; company admin cannot see platform OTP sends.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Seed migration | `email/backend/migrations/*_password_reset_otp_template.ts` |
| Template render | `email/backend/src/services/template.service.ts` — `userName`, `otp` placeholders |
| History scope | `email/backend/src/routes/history.routes.ts`, controller/middleware |
| Templates scope | `email/backend/src/routes/templates.routes.ts`, controller/middleware |
| Editor placeholder help | `email/frontend/src/features/templates/pages/TemplateEditorPage.tsx` |
| History empty state note | `email/frontend/src/features/history/pages/HistoryPage.tsx` (company admin + system mail) |

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w email-root`; manual `POST /api/v1/internal/send` with `templateSlug: password_reset_otp`

Spec: [03-email-history-templates.md](./03-email-history-templates.md)

