## Phase 2 — Identity OTP backend

**Goal:** OTP generate/store/send, verify with **3-attempt lockout**, reset session, password update.

**Exit criteria:** Postman/curl flow — forgot → verify (wrong ×3 locks) → new code → verify → reset password.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| OTP + session migration | `identity/backend/migrations/*_password_reset_otp.ts` |
| `requestPasswordReset` | `identity/backend/src/services/auth.service.ts` — 4-digit OTP, 1-min TTL, Email send |
| `verifyResetOtp` | Same — `attempt_count`, lock at 3, `403 OTP_MAX_ATTEMPTS`, `attemptsRemaining` |
| `resetPassword` | Accept `resetSessionToken`; invalidate OTPs |
| Routes + Zod | `identity/backend/src/controllers/auth.controller.ts`, routes |
| Email client | Reuse `identity/backend/src/services/emailClient.service.ts` (1.9.0) |

**API contract:** [02-identity-otp-reset.md](./02-identity-otp-reset.md#api-summary)

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w identity-root`

