## Phase 3 — Identity OTP frontend

**Goal:** Three-step UI with countdown and attempt counter.

**Exit criteria:** Browser E2E reset; embed mode preserves redirect query; lockout UI after 3 wrong codes.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| `VerifyResetOtpPage` | `identity/frontend/src/features/auth/pages/VerifyResetOtpPage.tsx` — OTP input, 60s countdown, attempts remaining |
| Forgot flow | `ForgotPasswordPage.tsx`, `ForgotPasswordForm.tsx` — copy + navigate to verify |
| Reset flow | `ResetPasswordPage.tsx`, `ResetPasswordForm.tsx` — `resetSessionToken` from state/sessionStorage |
| Router | `identity/frontend/src/app/App.tsx` — `/verify-reset-otp` |
| API client | `identity/frontend/src/features/auth/services/authApi.ts` — `verifyResetOtp` |
| Lockout UX | Handle `403 OTP_MAX_ATTEMPTS`; disable form + link to forgot-password |
| Embed | Preserve `redirectQuery` / `parentOrigin` across all three steps |

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w identity-root`

Spec: [02-identity-otp-reset.md](./02-identity-otp-reset.md)

