## Phase 4 — Integration verification

**Goal:** E2E + role-scoped Email admin + security checklist.

**Exit criteria:** [07-implementation-plan.md](./07-implementation-plan.md) acceptance checklist passes.

| Check | Detail |
|-------|--------|
| E2E OTP reset | Forgot → email received → valid OTP → new password → login |
| 3-attempt lockout | 3 wrong OTPs → locked; new forgot-password issues fresh code |
| 1-min expiry | Server rejects expired OTP; UI countdown matches |
| Role UI | Super admin: all history + platform templates; company admin: scoped only |
| Security | No OTP in URL/logs; generic forgot-password response |
| Type-check | `identity-root`, `email-root` |

