## Cross-service integration

| Channel | Use |
|---------|-----|
| Internal HTTP | Identity BE → Email `POST /api/v1/internal/send` with `X-Email-Service-Key` |
| Template | `password_reset_otp` with payload `{ userName, otp }` |
| Queue/history | Email records system send (`company_id` null) |
| Identity FE | Never calls Email API — only Identity auth routes |
| Embed | WebOnOne iframe login → Identity forgot-password (no WebOnOne BE change) |

Pattern: [../1.9.0/05-platform-integration.md](../1.9.0/05-platform-integration.md)

