## Risks and open items

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| 4-digit OTP brute force | 1-min TTL + max 3 attempts + invalidate on lockout |
| Client/server timer drift | Server `expires_at` is authoritative; UI countdown is UX only |
| Legacy link reset (`?token=`) | Decide keep vs remove; OTP is primary path per spec |
| Company admin cannot see OTP reset history | Expected — system mail is platform-scoped; document empty state |
| Email down on forgot-password | Return generic success; log send failure server-side |

